{"story":{"id":"anomaly-abandoned-outpost-category","title":{"zh":"废弃观测站","en":"Abandoned Observation Post"},"category":"exploration","kind":"anomaly","image":"art/1847c49a9205c90405fe.webp","start":"anomalies:abandoned_outpost_category","chapters":4,"visible":true,"excerpt":{"zh":"一座破旧的观测站围绕着[big_rip_planet.GetName]旋转，但地表上并没有智慧生命存在的迹象。进一步调查或许可以得知原因。","en":"A tattered old observation post circles [big_rip_planet.GetName] but there are no signs of intelligent life on its surface. Closer investigation may give us the answer to why."},"tree":{"root":"n0","nodes":{"n0":{"doc":null,"children":["n1"]},"n1":{"doc":"anomalies:abandoned_outpost_category","parent":"n0","via":{"kind":"entry"},"children":["n2"]},"n2":{"doc":"distar.1030","parent":"n1","via":{"hooks":["on_success"],"kind":"research","source":"common/anomalies/95_anomaly_categories_distant_stars.txt:1112"},"children":["n3"]},"n3":{"doc":"special_projects:BIG_RIP","parent":"n2","via":{"option":"distar.1030.a","optionIndex":0,"kind":"option","source":"events/distant_stars_events_2.txt:2010"},"children":["n4"]},"n4":{"doc":"distar.1031","parent":"n3","via":{"hooks":["on_success"],"kind":"project","source":"common/special_projects/00_projects_distant_stars.txt:1089"},"children":[]}}}},"chapters":[{"id":"anomalies:abandoned_outpost_category","kind":"anomaly","title":{"zh":"废弃观测站","en":"Abandoned Observation Post"},"texts":[{"zh":"一座破旧的观测站围绕着[big_rip_planet.GetName]旋转，但地表上并没有智慧生命存在的迹象。进一步调查或许可以得知原因。","en":"A tattered old observation post circles [big_rip_planet.GetName] but there are no signs of intelligent life on its surface. Closer investigation may give us the answer to why."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/1847c49a9205c90405fe.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[],"next":[{"target":"distar.1030","kind":"research","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"research","source":"common/anomalies/95_anomaly_categories_distant_stars.txt:1112","hooks":["on_success"],"story":"anomaly-abandoned-outpost-category"}],"source":{"file":"common/anomalies/95_anomaly_categories_distant_stars.txt","line":1101},"names":{"big_rip_planet.GetName":{"zh":"这颗星球","en":"this planet"}}},{"id":"distar.1030","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"废弃观测站","en":"Abandoned Observation Post"},"texts":[{"zh":"观测站上的所有数据储存设备都已被清空，并且所有可指向其原主人的证据也都已被小心翼翼地抹去。[big_rip_planet.GetName]上明显出了什么差错。智慧生命曾经存在的唯一迹象，就是散布在星球上的半完成的大都市废墟，似乎在建造中途就被放弃了。","en":"All the observation post's data storage units have been wiped and extensive care has been taken to eliminate any evidence that could lead back to its owners. Something clearly went wrong on [big_rip_planet.GetName]. The only signs of intelligent life are the crumbling husks of half-finished megacities, seemingly abandoned mid-construction, scattered across its surface and the looming holotemple in their midst."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/d47236d81da9c8a331fc.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"distar.1030.a","label":{"zh":"进行调查。","en":"Investigate."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"special_projects:BIG_RIP","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/distant_stars_events_2.txt:2010","story":"anomaly-abandoned-outpost-category"}],"terminal":false},{"key":"distar.1030.b","label":{"zh":"离开。","en":"Leave."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[{"target":"story.5","kind":"delay","conditional":false,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"delay","delay":[{"days":"30"}],"source":"events/distant_stars_events_2.txt:2003","hooks":["immediate"],"story":"origin_fear_of_the_dark"}],"source":{"file":"events/distant_stars_events_2.txt","line":1991},"names":{"big_rip_planet.GetName":{"zh":"这颗星球","en":"this planet"}}},{"id":"special_projects:BIG_RIP","kind":"project","title":{"zh":"废弃观测站","en":"Abandoned Observation Post"},"texts":[{"zh":"位于[big_rip_planet.GetName]轨道上的废弃观测站的数据储存装置已被清空。我们必须派人到星球上去，才能弄明白这里原先居住的智慧生物出了什么事。","en":"The data storage units on the observation post orbiting [big_rip_planet.GetName] have been wiped. We will have to send a team planetside if we want to get to the bottom of what happened to the intelligent lifeforms previously inhabiting the planet."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/1847c49a9205c90405fe.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[],"next":[{"target":"distar.1031","kind":"project","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"project","source":"common/special_projects/00_projects_distant_stars.txt:1089","hooks":["on_success"],"story":"anomaly-abandoned-outpost-category"}],"source":{"file":"common/special_projects/00_projects_distant_stars.txt","line":1072},"names":{"big_rip_planet.GetName":{"zh":"这颗星球","en":"this planet"}}},{"id":"distar.1031","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"灰蛊风暴","en":"The Gray Tempest"},"texts":[{"zh":"尽管他们拼命试图掩盖，观测者拙劣的干预痕迹仍在[big_rip_planet.GetName]上随处可见……\n\n证据表明，星球上原本居住着一个正在宗教觉醒的过程之中的以灵能相连的植物集体意识。此时一个被称为守门者的神秘外星种族毫无预兆地突然降临。从那时起，这个植物物种就疯狂地痴迷于即将来临的名为“灰色风暴”的世界末日。它们原本和平的信条也扭曲成了自灭的狂信。出于对一个永远不会来临的末日的恐惧，尽管反复尝试强行灌溉，这星系中最古老的物种之一还是在数月之间枯萎殆尽了。","en":"For all their efforts at secrecy, traces of the observers' clumsy meddling are everywhere on [big_rip_planet.GetName]...\n\nEvidence suggests that the planet was inhabited by a psionically linked consciousness of plantoids that were in the midst of a religious awakening, when a mysterious alien race, referred to as the gatekeepers, descended upon them without warning. From that point on the plants became obsessed with the idea of an impending apocalyptic event called 'the Gray Tempest.' Their formerly peaceful religion soon spiraled into a suicide cult. Within a matter of months one of the galaxy's most ancient lifeforms had wilted away for fear of a doomsday that would never come, despite repeated attempts at forced rehydration."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/d47236d81da9c8a331fc.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"distar.1031.a","label":{"zh":"真是一团糟……","en":"What a mess..."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"distar.9000